.\" Man page for atlas command
.\" Updated: July 2026
.TH ATLAS 1 "July 2026" "atlas 0.13.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
atlas \- project state engine for ADHD-friendly workflow management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B atlas
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIcommand\fR] [\fIarguments\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B atlas
is a standalone Node.js CLI providing Clean Architecture-based state management
for developer workflows. It tracks projects, sessions, captures, and context
with ADHD-friendly features like streak tracking, celebration helpers, and
time blindness awareness.
.PP
Atlas stores data in \fI~/.atlas/\fR and supports both filesystem and SQLite
backends. It integrates with .STATUS files for project state tracking.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-storage\fR \fItype\fR
Storage backend: filesystem or sqlite (default: filesystem).
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version number.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help for command.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Project Management
.TP
\fBproject add\fR [\fIpath\fR]
Register a project. Options: \fB\-\-tags\fR, \fB\-\-status\fR.
.TP
\fBproject list\fR
List all projects. Options: \fB\-\-status\fR, \fB\-\-tag\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR, \fB\-\-count\fR, \fB\-\-suggest\fR.
.TP
\fBproject show\fR \fIname\fR
Show project details. Options: \fB\-\-json\fR.
.TP
\fBproject remove\fR \fIname\fR
Unregister a project.
.SS Session Management
.TP
\fBsession start\fR [\fIproject\fR]
Start a work session on the specified project.
.TP
\fBsession end\fR [\fInote\fR]
End current session with optional note.
.TP
\fBsession status\fR
Show current session. Options: \fB\-\-format\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR.
.TP
\fBsession export\fR [\fIfile\fR]
Export sessions to iCal/ICS format. Options: \fB\-\-format\fR, \fB\-\-days\fR, \fB\-\-project\fR.
.SS Context & Focus
.TP
\fBfocus\fR \fIproject\fR [\fItext\fR]
Get or set project focus.
.TP
\fBwhere\fR [\fIproject\fR]
Show current context \(em "Where was I?"
.TP
\fBpark\fR [\fInote\fR]
Park current context for later. Options: \fB\-\-force\fR, \fB\-\-keep\-session\fR.
.TP
\fBunpark\fR \fIid\fR
Restore a parked context.
.TP
\fBparked\fR
List parked contexts.
.SS Capture & Track
.TP
\fBcatch\fR \fItext\fR
Quick capture an idea or task. Options: \fB\-p\fR (project), \fB\-t\fR (type).
.TP
\fBinbox\fR
Show captured items. Options: \fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-type\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR, \fB\-\-triage\fR, \fB\-\-stats\fR, \fB\-\-count\fR.
.TP
\fBcrumb\fR \fItext\fR
Leave a breadcrumb trail marker. Options: \fB\-p\fR (project).
.TP
\fBtrail\fR [\fIproject\fR]
Show breadcrumb trail. Options: \fB\-d\fR (days), \fB\-\-limit\fR.
.SS Task Management
.TP
\fBtask add\fR \fIdescription\fR
Add a new task. Options: \fB\-p\fR (project), \fB\-\-due\fR, \fB\-\-priority\fR.
.TP
\fBtask list\fR
List tasks. Options: \fB\-\-completed\fR, \fB\-\-incomplete\fR, \fB\-\-overdue\fR, \fB\-\-due\-soon\fR, \fB\-\-project\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR.
.TP
\fBtask done\fR \fIid\fR
Mark task as completed.
.TP
\fBtask rm\fR \fIid\fR
Delete a task.
.SS Status & Analytics
.TP
\fBstatus\fR [\fIproject\fR]
Get or update project status. Options: \fB\-\-set\fR, \fB\-\-progress\fR, \fB\-\-focus\fR, \fB\-\-next\fR, \fB\-\-complete\fR, \fB\-\-then\fR, \fB\-\-increment\fR, \fB\-\-create\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR.
.TP
\fBstats\fR [\fIperiod\fR]
Show session analytics. Options: \fB\-d\fR (days), \fB\-p\fR (project), \fB\-\-format\fR, \fB\-e\fR (export), \fB\-\-velocity\fR, \fB\-\-patterns\fR, \fB\-\-calibrate\fR.
.TP
\fBplan\fR
Morning planning ritual. Options: \fB\-\-ecosystem\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR.
.TP
\fBagenda\fR [\fIwindow\-days\fR]
Show tasks and schedule items. Options: \fB\-\-format\fR.
.SS Setup & Diagnostics
.TP
\fBinit\fR
Initialize atlas in current directory. Options: \fB\-g\fR (global), \fB\-t\fR (template), \fB\-n\fR (name), \fB\-\-list\-templates\fR.
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR
Audit projects for settings contract. Options: \fB\-\-kind\fR, \fB\-\-all\fR, \fB\-\-fix\fR, \fB\-\-write\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR.
.TP
\fBsync\fR
Sync registry from .STATUS files. Options: \fB\-d\fR (dry\-run), \fB\-w\fR (watch), \fB\-p\fR (paths), \fB\-\-remove\-orphans\fR, \fB\-\-from\-status\fR, \fB\-\-research\fR.
.TP
\fBmigrate\fR
Migrate data between storage backends. Options: \fB\-f\fR (from), \fB\-t\fR (to), \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR.
.SS Configuration
.TP
\fBconfig paths\fR
Show configured scan paths.
.TP
\fBconfig add\-path\fR \fIpath\fR
Add a scan path.
.TP
\fBconfig remove\-path\fR \fIpath\fR
Remove a scan path.
.TP
\fBconfig show\fR
Show all configuration.
.TP
\fBconfig setup\fR
Interactive configuration wizard.
.TP
\fBconfig prefs\fR
Manage preferences.
.SS Templates
.TP
\fBtemplate list\fR
List all available templates.
.TP
\fBtemplate show\fR \fIid\fR
Show template content.
.TP
\fBtemplate create\fR \fIid\fR
Create a new custom template. Options: \fB\-t\fR (type).
.TP
\fBtemplate export\fR \fIid\fR
Export a built\-in template for customization.
.TP
\fBtemplate delete\fR \fIid\fR
Delete a custom template.
.TP
\fBtemplate dir\fR
Show custom templates directory.
.SS Dashboard
.TP
\fBdashboard\fR, \fBdash\fR
Launch interactive dashboard TUI (Ink\-powered).
.SS Completions
.TP
\fBcompletions\fR [\fIshell\fR]
Generate shell completions (zsh|bash|fish).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBATLAS_DATA_DIR\fR
Override default data directory (~/.atlas/).
.TP
\fBATLAS_STORAGE\fR
Override storage backend (filesystem|sqlite).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/
Default data directory.
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/config.json
User preferences and scan paths.
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/projects.json
Project registry (filesystem backend).
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/sessions.json
Session history.
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/captures.json
Quick captures (inbox).
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/breadcrumbs.json
Context trail markers.
.TP
.I ~/.atlas/tasks.json
Task records.
.TP
.I .STATUS
Per\-project status file (YAML format).
.SH EXAMPLES
Start working on a project:
.RS
.nf
atlas session start atlas
.fi
.RE
.PP
Quick capture an idea:
.RS
.nf
atlas catch "Add dark mode toggle" \-p atlas \-t idea
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show project status:
.RS
.nf
atlas status atlas
.fi
.RE
.PP
Check session analytics:
.RS
.nf
atlas stats week
.fi
.RE
.PP
Run morning planning:
.RS
.nf
atlas plan
.fi
.RE
.PP
Audit all projects:
.RS
.nf
atlas doctor \-\-all
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR session (1),
.BR project (1),
.BR status (1)
